    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily follow-up drafts\nManual and scheduled triggers share the same path. The SQL RPC selects open deals idle for more than 3 days, with email, and no draft since their latest sales activity. At most 100 deals per run. Zero eligible deals are silent.\n\nGmail creates drafts only. Marker updates do not count as sales activity. Run one copy at a time. A crash after Gmail creates a draft but before Supabase records its ID needs reconciliation in Gmail before retrying; cross-service writes are not atomic.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 760
      },
      "id": "edcca32d-d7d9-57da-9eb3-926f4dc026da",
      "name": "Follow-up Operations Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        250,
        -390
      ]
    }
